OL,3,AScotland 'not like Manchester', Swinney
OL,4,Asays in dig at PM Burnham
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Swinney has taken aim at those who
OL,7,Fthink Scotland "should be just like
OL,8,FManchester" as he vowed Scotland would
OL,9,Fsoon be an independent nation.
OL,11,FIn a closing speech at the SNP
OL,12,Fconference that did not mention Prime
OL,13,FMinister Andy Burnham by name, Swinney
OL,14,Fissued a veiled retort to the former
OL,15,FGreater Manchester mayor after he
OL,16,Fvisited Scotland.
OL,18,FThe first minister, speaking in
OL,19,FAberdeen, also announced that the
OL,20,Fcountry's bus network would be brought
OL,21,Funder public control by the end of the
OL,22,Fparliamentary term in 2031.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
